### Health

GET [http://localhost:8000/health](http://localhost:8000/health)

### Chat — equator demo (Supabase schema)

POST [http://localhost:8000/chat](http://localhost:8000/chat)
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Show me psal vs pres near the equator for March 2023 including temp and coords" }

### Chat — Arabian Sea BGC monthly

POST [http://localhost:8000/chat](http://localhost:8000/chat)
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Monthly avg doxy and chla for Arabian Sea for last 6 months" }

### Chat — nearest floats (approx box filter + recent time)

POST [http://localhost:8000/chat](http://localhost:8000/chat)
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Nearest platform_number to lat 12.5 lon 72.3 observed in last 30 days" }
